{"id":"oh","lemma":"oh","pos":"intj","rank":80,"glosses":["oh (expression of awe, surprise, pain or realization)"],"ipa":"/ˈo/","examples":[{"text":"Oh, no te preocupes.","en":"Oh, don't worry.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799420"},{"text":"¡Oh! Eso es terrible.","en":"Oh! That's too bad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734380"},{"text":"Tú no tienes una pista, ¿oh si?","en":"You don't have a clue, do you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804063"},{"text":"¡Oh! Lamento oír eso.","en":"Oh! I'm sorry to hear that."},{"text":"¡Oh no, no otra vez!","en":"Oh no, not again!"}]}